   "title": "Core",
   "section": "Lower Division",
   "notes": "Prior to declaring the major students must complete AMERSTD 10, AMERSTD 10AC, or AMERSTD C20 and one prerequisite course. Students must complete each course with a letter grade of C or higher. No more than two courses from one department can be used to fulfill this requirement.\nBeginning Fall 2026, students who earn a C- or lower in AMERSTD 10 or AMERSTD 10AC may repeat the course once to declare the American Studies major. This policy applies only to students entering UC Berkeley in Fall 2026 or later.",
